# Repository whitespace policy for review gates.
# CRLF at end of line is tolerated for existing blobs and is NOT reported as
# trailing whitespace by `git diff --check` (cr-at-eol). Real trailing spaces
# and tabs are still reported. No text normalization is forced here to avoid
# mass renormalization of historical CRLF files; new/edited source is LF.
* whitespace=cr-at-eol
